  {
    "location": "html-block:64",
    "text": "Advanced Transformer Protection and Control",
    "heading": "MiCOM P64x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:65",
    "text": "Part of PowerLogic™",
    "heading": "MiCOM P64x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:66",
    "text": "Easergy MiCOM P64x series provides fast and complete protection for transformer faults, preserving service life. Designed for two and three winding transformers (including autotransformers), it is easy to use and the setting wizard requires only nameplate data. Models available: MiCOM P642, MiCOM P643, MiCOM P645",
    "heading": "MiCOM P64x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:67",
    "text": "Ask the community",
    "heading": "MiCOM P64x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:68",
    "text": "Contact sales",
    "heading": "MiCOM P64x"
  },
